  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| @&#8203;babel/core | devDependencies | minor | `7.2.2` -> `7.3.3` | [homepage](https://babeljs.io/), [source](https://togithub.com/babel/babel) |\n| @&#8203;babel/plugin-proposal-class-properties | devDependencies | patch | `7.3.0` -> `7.3.3` | [source](https://togithub.com/babel/babel) |\n| @&#8203;babel/preset-typescript | devDependencies | minor | `7.1.0` -> `7.3.3` | [source](https://togithub.com/babel/babel) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>babel/babel</summary>\n\n### [`v7.3.3`](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/releases/v7.3.3)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/compare/v7.2.2...v7.3.3)\n\n#### v7.3.3 (2019-02-15)\n\n##### :eyeglasses: Spec Compliancy\n\n-   `babel-generator`\n    -   [#&#8203;9501](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9501) Correctly output escapes in directives ([@&#8203;nicolo-ribaudo](https://togithub.com/nicolo-ribaudo))\n\n##### :bug: Bug Fix\n\n-   `babel-parser`\n    -   [#&#8203;9477](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9477) Fix regression with let ([@&#8203;danez](https://togithub.com/danez))\n    -   [#&#8203;9431](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9431) Typescript function destructured params ([@&#8203;mhcgrq](https://togithub.com/mhcgrq))\n    -   [#&#8203;9463](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9463) Fix range for TypeScript optional parameter in arrow function ([@&#8203;existentialism](https://togithub.com/existentialism))\n\n##### :nail_care: Polish\n\n-   `babel-plugin-proposal-class-properties`, `babel-plugin-transform-classes`, `babel-plugin-transform-parameters`\n    -   [#&#8203;9458](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9458) Fix duplicated assertThisInitialized calls in constructors ([@&#8203;rubennorte](https://togithub.com/rubennorte))\n\n##### :house: Internal\n\n-   Other\n    -   [#&#8203;9517](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9517) Add duplicate-package-checker-webpack-plugin ([@&#8203;nicolo-ribaudo](https://togithub.com/nicolo-ribaudo))\n    -   [#&#8203;9469](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9469) Exclude generate [@&#8203;babel/types](https://togithub.com/babel/types) files from coverage report ([@&#8203;nicolo-ribaudo](https://togithub.com/nicolo-ribaudo))\n-   `babel-parser`\n    -   [#&#8203;9491](https://togithub.com/babel/babel/pull/9491) Better error output in parser tests ([@&#8203;danez](https://togithub.com/danez))\n\n##### Committers: 8\n\n-   Alec ([@&#8203;Alec321](https://togithub.com/Alec321))\n-   Brian Ng ([@&#8203;existentialism](https://togithub.com/existentialism))\n-   Daniel Tschinder ([@&#8203;danez](https://togithub.com/danez))\n-   Downpooooour ([@&#8203;mhcgrq](https://togithub.com/mhcgrq))\n-   Ilya Lesik ([@&#8203;ilyalesik](https://togithub.com/ilyalesik))\n-   Nicolò Ribaudo ([@&#8203;nicolo-ribaudo](https://togithub.com/nicolo-ribaudo))\n-   Rubén Norte ([@&#8203;rubennorte](https://togithub.com/rubennorte))\n-   Yifei Fu ([@&#8203;yifei-fu](https://togithub.com/yifei-fu))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about these updates again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
